      <li><strong>Limerick guide:</strong> <a href="/guides/limerick-dispensary-guide">Town-level overview of Limerick dispensaries</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p>If you have a Maine medical cannabis card or a valid out-of-state card from a reciprocity state, mention your patient status when ordering. Adult-use customers should bring a valid government photo ID showing they are 21 or older.</p>
